  "releaseNotes": "Enhancements\n- Improved performance when importing large DataTables into worksheets, reducing load times for multi-million-cell spreadsheets\n\nBug Fixes\n- Fixed an issue where copying certain styled XLSX workbooks could result in a corrupted file and loss of styles\n\nUpdates\n- Added a .NET 8 build of IronXL compiled against SixLabors.ImageSharp 4.1.3 and SixLabors.Fonts 3.x\n- Updated IronSoftware.System.Drawing to 2026.11.3 to resolve CVEs CVE-2026-106110 through CVE-2026-106116 via SixLabors.ImageSharp 4.1.3 on .NET 8+. Earlier .NET frameworks remain unaffected by this fix\n- Updated internal dependencies",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
